{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>For a nation lost counsel, they are.</b> In the Sifrei, Rabbi Yehudah expounds it through עד ראו עתה — against Israel, and Rabbi Nehemiah expounds it — against the nations. Rabbi Yehudah expounds it concerning Israel, and it refers back to what precedes; this is what it says: I said I would drive them to extinction — for Israel — <b>for a nation lost counsel, they are</b> — they lost the counsel that was given them, which is the Torah."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:10.159269711Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}